      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在我离开北海道之后，不知道自己能不能追求到梦想而不安时，\r\n铃鹿同学奔跑的模样映入我眼中……",
      "source_fingerprint": "58f34e945b3ee44feb1ee4eb8045afcd984bb16cb56729fa534f338224b9b1b3",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
