      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我的双眼就好像要被那模样吸进去一般，根本挪不开视线……",
      "source_fingerprint": "e7ec0c0f45030450ab426fb413f2764d9f5d4721b61e7ecb607c6fbd20fb7e4b",
