    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f1b09964d083b11f14eb76fd",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "从那之后，我也一直以“成为铃鹿同学那样的赛马娘”为目标奔跑着，\r\n但是……",
      "source_fingerprint": "0554aaa854311d220b636083ae65281ccba52b0c506dd5253c43d99a527dff15",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/02/0006/storytimeline_020006101.json",
      "json_path": [
