      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/49/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6785d06e65d925f8ebb48267",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "目白赖恩",
      "source_fingerprint": "27f6e72e0c5efa49958dfacdc8da250e2490660afaa33a92ed97b52f06851b85",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/02/0006/storytimeline_020006101.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        5,
        "name"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/5/name"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:858e60d2098bf316c1b7d685",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "终于要和“黄金世代”的德比赛马娘初次对决了呢～",
      "source_fingerprint": "8a2be29003a04e8c8733594468ac55591175c85762a4308002c9a28b2f3ecfca",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/02/0006/storytimeline_020006101.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        5,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/5/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1818715e6265d87a32565d7e",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "特别周的话语戛然而止。她低下头，沉默不语。",
      "source_fingerprint": "982f106918b039e54e608919ef6284c1a4fed4c058788223b764927128ef1cab",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/02/0006/storytimeline_020006101.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        50,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/50/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a272f2ff8aa2b5cb46a6f704",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "可能即便是她自己也没注意到，\r\n无声铃鹿奔跑的模样早已在她心中成为了不可或缺的支柱。",
      "source_fingerprint": "0bc83acab40f281ce7c30a094aa234eb687b155a24a164a52e683eef51add65a",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/02/0006/storytimeline_020006101.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        51,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/51/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:e688722e938194e3b67ab85d",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "我看向跑道上的无声铃鹿——",
      "source_fingerprint": "0c54e83257c91963746cf8cc0fd403764a49f2df99e0593b0590cfafe7403319",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/02/0006/storytimeline_020006101.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        52,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/52/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:144ae4df27de1b64d9ac6da5",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "在第一次见到无声铃鹿的奔跑时，\r\n我便觉得她是个能够享受奔跑的赛马娘。",
      "source_fingerprint": "9cb2b95ec98ad2f67d0c6d685700d9f828d31d4b95ca871ad411b029ff0c5e41",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/02/0006/storytimeline_020006101.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        53,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/53/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8addaeefd0c1756744129a41",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "不久后，她找到了真正属于自己的奔跑方式，\r\n凡是见过她奔跑的人都对她抱有无比的期待……",
      "source_fingerprint": "cf6a9bc00bc96655c440f5aea1c442c54c646db4ffc4a9370d84510103c207e7",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
      "source_path": "assets/story/data/02/0006/storytimeline_020006101.json",
      "json_path": [
        "text_block_list",
        54,
        "text"
      ],
      "json_pointer": "/text_block_list/54/text"
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f0c66d085e6d1c8ea45496e1",
      "kind": "story",
      "source_language": "zh-CN",
      "source_text": "<username>",
      "source_fingerprint": "2414b340167d18f7f395d0abe85eba52db9d10870c84e4d7056ed2309246e334",
      "source_repo": "Hachimi-Hachimi/tl-zh-cn",
      "source_commit": "67f8551f77807292cebd2b20b2c752b652393835",
